{"changelog":"## 逗逼下载器 DBDown 0.6.0\r\n\r\n- Kotlin / Jetpack Compose 原生界面，首页和下载双页悬浮标签，支持页面与胶囊跟手滑动、随时打断切换。\r\n- 支持 B 站视频、BV / AV 号、b23 短链和抖音完整分享文案。\r\n- 新增抖音图文 / 图集：按顺序保存图片，或合成为带可用配乐的 MP4；每张图片显示 3 秒并保持比例。\r\n- 下载列表展示进度、速度和完成状态，支持全局暂停 / 继续、断点续传及 1–6 个并发任务（默认 3 个）。新增任务自动回到列表顶部。\r\n- 已完成内容支持打开与系统分享；图集支持多图一起分享。\r\n- 前台剪贴板智能检测及顶部下载提示；后台通过系统分享入口添加任务。\r\n- 设置支持官方网页登录、版本显示和主动检查更新；更新包校验 SHA-256、包名、版本和签名。\r\n\r\n支持 Android 13 及以上，目标 Android API 37。视频保存在 Movies/逗逼下载器，图片保存在 Pictures/逗逼下载器。\r\n平台登录不额外赋予会员或付费权限；平台风控、接口和网页变化仍可能导致解析或登录失败。图集合成使用本地幻灯片，不复现官方 App 特效。\r\n","channel":"stable","maxForcedVersionCode":0,"policyRevision":1,"publishedAt":"2026-09-27T16:39:17Z","releaseUrl":"https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/tag/v0.6.0","schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"de92ef0489da5da9183b2b6a1ca2215c82301abd76538a26e57aa62438408be9","size":30460026,"urls":["https://v6.gh-proxy.org/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://gh.3w.pm/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://gh.jasonzeng.dev/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://gh-proxy.org/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://gh.monlor.com/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://xget.xi-xu.me/gh/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://ghproxy.vip/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://ghfast.top/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://gh.llkk.cc/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://ghproxy.net/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.6.0.apk","https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.0/DBDown-0.